WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.085 --> 00:01:11.841
song The pals will have a party.

2
00:01:13.862 --> 00:01:15.162
Green writes a note.

3
00:01:27.409 --> 00:01:28.970
Red gives it to the knight.

4
00:01:37.195 --> 00:01:39.016
Green bakes a big cake.

5
00:01:41.996 --> 00:01:45.539
He cuts it with a knife.

6
00:01:45.739 --> 00:01:47.141
Pink knits with yarn.

7
00:01:48.181 --> 00:01:53.486
Pink: I knit a pretty scarf.

8
00:01:55.187 --> 00:01:56.709
Yellow puts it in a box.

9
00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:01.313
Yellow: I will wrap the box.

10
00:02:05.176 --> 00:02:06.497
Blue makes a wreath.

11
00:02:10.748 --> 00:02:12.649
Red: That's a nice wreath.

12
00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.091
The pals write on a card.

13
00:02:27.255 --> 00:02:27.836
Knock! Knock!

14
00:02:33.478 --> 00:02:34.739
Blue turns the knob.

15
00:02:36.799 --> 00:02:46.444
It's the knight!

16
00:02:46.464 --> 00:02:48.265
Knight: Is this party for me?

17
00:02:48.285 --> 00:02:50.027
Pals: Yes!

18
00:02:50.047 --> 00:02:53.229
Knight: Thank you!

19
00:02:55.891 --> 00:02:57.312
They all eat cake.
